0cEl3ZnBpc0hQUzllQ2Nud2psUDlyemFxd1ZXbFh6ZGlCbDhmbDVnY1NrWkpVeHloQTZZcVFTS2hNYTdNYTRfazJGUkUyZURPQlhmVWV5MzN5a1VKbGpNWVVneGcyZHU3azdjYTlIcHVmUS1EOWJUaHJibTBJbDAzWmlVN0ZQYnFhQ2M0WnlBOTJIajdnRXpCUVY3NXQzTnZvcjFrWjRZVzdqTWJPTQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-09","zh":"達美航空、聯合航空和捷藍航空現出售商務艙座位，但不提供商務艙優惠"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":2},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-11","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/27904/000002790426000013/dal-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"As a global airline based in the United States, we connect customers across our expansive global network with a commitment to ensuring that the future of travel is connected, personalized and enjoyable. In 2025, we served over 200 million customers safely, reliably and with industry-leading customer service innovation.","zh":null},{"en":"As we celebrated our centennial year in 2025, we continued to differentiate Delta from the industry and to invest in extending our competitive advantages. These enduring competitive advantages, which support our trusted consumer brand, include our people and culture, operational reliability, global network, customer loyalty and financial foundation.","zh":null},{"en":"The Delta people and culture are our strongest competitive advantage. Our more than 100,000 employees provide world-class travel experiences for our customers and best-in-class service. We believe that Delta's brand transcends the industry, powered by our people's outstanding work and passion for serving our customers. For 2025, Delta was named No. 15 on the Fortune 100 Best Companies to Work For list and was ranked No. 2 in the Forbes ranking of the World's Best Employers.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The airline industry is highly competitive, marked by significant competition with respect to routes, fares, schedules (both timing and frequency), operational reliability, services, products, customer service and loyalty programs. Over the last 20 years, the industry has evolved significantly both domestically and internationally. Consolidation, international alliances, immunized joint ventures and subsidized government-sponsored international carriers have shaped the competitive landscape in the industry, resulting in airlines and alliances with significant financial resources, extensive global networks and competitive cost structures. In addition to competition from other carriers, we compete to a lesser extent with surface transportation and technological alternatives such as virtual meetings, teleconferencing or videoconferencing.","zh":null},{"en":"Our domestic operations are subject to significant competition from traditional network carriers, including American Airlines and United Airlines, national point-to-point carriers, including Alaska Airlines, JetBlue Airways and Southwest Airlines, and other discount or ultra-low-cost carriers, including Allegiant Air, Frontier Airlines and Spirit Airlines. Some of these carriers have business models primarily focused on maintaining low costs, with the intention of providing service at lower fares to destinations served by Delta. In particular, we face significant competition at our domestic hubs and key airports either directly at those airports or at the hubs of other airlines that are located in close proximity. We also face competition in small- to medium-sized markets from regional jet operations of other carriers.","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Airline","val":58287000000,"zh":"Airline"},{"name":"Refinery","val":6961000000,"zh":"Refinery"}],"total":63364000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Passenger","val":51768000000,"zh":"Passenger"},{"name":"Passenger Air Traffic","val":45488000000,"zh":"Passenger Air Traffic"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":10696000000,"zh":"Product & Service Other"},{"name":"Product & Service Other Refinery","val":5077000000,"zh":"Product & Service Other Refinery"},{"name":"Passenger Loyalty Travel Awards","val":4237000000,"zh":"Passenger Loyalty Travel Awards"},{"name":"Product & Service Other Loyalty Program","val":3362000000,"zh":"Product & Service Other Loyalty Program"},{"name":"Passenger Travel Related Services","val":2043000000,"zh":"Passenger Travel Related Services"},{"name":"Product & Service Other Miscellaneous","val":1320000000,"zh":"Product & Service Other Miscellaneous"},{"name":"Product & Service Other Ancillary Businesses","val":937000000,"zh":"Product & Service Other Ancillary Businesses"},{"name":"Cargo & Freight","val":900000000,"zh":"Cargo & Freight"}],"total":63364000000}},"peers":["AAL","UAL","LUV","CCL","RCL"]}}